{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/connectivity\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph\/stronglyconnectedcomponents()"]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/stronglyConnectedComponents()"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph"]]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The strongly connected components: maximal sets of vertices each reaching every other, by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Tarjan’s algorithm.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"stronglyConnectedComponents"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12Connectivity10ComponentsV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Components"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"modules":[{"relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"],"name":"Connectivity"}],"title":"stronglyConnectedComponents()","extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","remoteSource":{"fileName":"StronglyConnectedComponents.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Connectivity\/StronglyConnectedComponents.swift#L148"},"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P12ConnectivityE27stronglyConnectedComponentsAD0G0VyxGyF"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"stronglyConnectedComponents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/Components","text":"Components","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Connectivity10ComponentsV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Components are in the order Tarjan’s algorithm completes them, on a depth-first search"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with roots in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order and successors in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"successors(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":" order. That is a reverse"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"topological order of the condensation: every edge between components goes from a later"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"component to an earlier one, so "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"reversed()"},{"type":"text","text":" lists the components with every edge going"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"forward. Each component lists its vertices in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each component’s first vertex is its earliest in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":", so on a graph whose vertex"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"positions are insertion order ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"StableDirectedGraph"},{"type":"text","text":"), one sort by that vertex’s position"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"puts the components in insertion order, O(C log C) for C components:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let inInsertionOrder = graph.stronglyConnectedComponents()","    .sorted { graph.vertexPosition(of: $0.first!) < graph.vertexPosition(of: $1.first!) }"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On any graph, one pass over "},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" lists them in "},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" order, O(V):"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let components = graph.stronglyConnectedComponents()","let inVertexOrder = graph.vertices.compactMap { vertex in","    let component = components[components.component(of: vertex)]","    return component.first == vertex ? component : nil","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"O(V + E).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","name":"Complexity","style":"note"}]}],"references":{"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity":{"title":"Connectivity","identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity","url":"\/documentation\/connectivity","type":"topic","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","role":"collection"},"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity/Components":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/Components","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Components","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/connectivity\/components","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A partition of a graph’s vertices into components, in a documented order: a collection of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"components, each a slice of vertices in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order, with an O(1) "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"component(of:)"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Components","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Components","type":"topic"},"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity/GraphProtocols/DirectedGraph/stronglyConnectedComponents()":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"stronglyConnectedComponents"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Components","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Connectivity10ComponentsV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"title":"stronglyConnectedComponents()","identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/stronglyConnectedComponents()","url":"\/documentation\/connectivity\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph\/stronglyconnectedcomponents()","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"The strongly connected components: maximal sets of vertices each reaching every other, by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Tarjan’s algorithm.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity/GraphProtocols":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/connectivity\/graphprotocols","abstract":[],"title":"GraphProtocols","type":"topic"},"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity/GraphProtocols/DirectedGraph":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"extension"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P","kind":"identifier","text":"DirectedGraph"}],"title":"DirectedGraph","identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph","url":"\/documentation\/connectivity\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph","type":"topic","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"DirectedGraph"}],"role":"symbol"}}}